  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "The youngest man to start September's Manchester derby was Kobbie Mainoo. Twenty-one years and one hundred and forty-seven days old.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "KOBBIE MAINOO",
        "sub": "Derby day · 13 Sep 2026",
        "pill": "AGE-MATCH",
        "person": "mainoo"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So what had the derby legends done at exactly the same age?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "mainoo",
        "label": "21 years, 147 days",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristiano Ronaldo at that age: summer twenty oh-six. Eighteen Premier League goals in ninety-five games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Ronaldo at 21y 147d",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "18",
            "l": "PL goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "95",
            "l": "PL games"
          }
        ],
        "person": "ronaldo"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wayne Rooney at that age, March twenty oh-seven, already had more than forty Premier League goals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "rooney",
        "label": "40+ PL goals by 21y 147d",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Phil Foden, October twenty twenty-one: sixteen Premier League goals, and three title medals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "PL 2017-18"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "PL 2018-19"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "PL 2020-21"
          }
        ],
        "person": "foden"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Mainoo? Four Premier League goals in around eighty-two games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Premier League goals at 21y 147d",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Wayne Rooney",
            "value": "40+",
            "club": "mun"
          },
          {
            "name": "Cristiano Ronaldo",
            "value": "18",
            "club": "mun"
          },
          {
            "name": "Phil Foden",
            "value": "16",
            "club": "mci"
          },
          {
            "name": "Kobbie Mainoo",
            "value": "4",
            "club": "mun",
            "hl": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Last place. But that's not the whole story.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "NOT SO FAST",
        "person": "mainoo",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rooney, Ronaldo and Foden were attackers. Mainoo sits in midfield, where goals are a bonus.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "DIFFERENT JOB",
        "body": "Rooney and Ronaldo played up front or out wide. Foden plays in the attacking line. Mainoo is a deeper central midfielder."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now match the games. Ronaldo needed ninety-five Premier League games for eighteen goals. About one every five.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "One goal every…",
        "real": {
          "label": "Ronaldo, by 21y 147d",
          "value": "5 games"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Mainoo, by 21y 147d",
          "value": "20 games"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But in the biggest derby of all, Mainoo delivered. He scored the winner against City in the twenty twenty-four FA Cup final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "mci",
        "away": "mun",
        "hs": 1,
        "as": 2,
        "date": "25 May 2024",
        "comp": "FA Cup final",
        "note": "Mainoo scores the winner"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So who was the best twenty-one-year-old in derby history? Tell me in the comments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "The best at 21?",
